Version 1.1.0 adapts ideas and code from:

  omarchy-winvm — https://github.com/jonspinks/omarchy-winvm
  (commit 7d62aabf19694a20df7492dd12b573d7c0f9318e)

Adapted parts, each marked with a header comment:
  - bin/Sample.sh   from bin/winvm-sample   (unprivileged cgroup and /proc sampling)
  - bin/Connect.sh  from bin/winvm-connect  (direct RDP reconnect with saved credentials over a file descriptor)
  - Launch.sh stop  from bin/winvm-stop     (handing the stop to a waiting launcher)
  - Logic.js        from Model.js           (rates from counter deltas, formatting)
  - MeterRow.qml    from MeterRow.qml       (resource meter row)

